Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.35,0:40:52.48,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}恋の電波　送受信！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.74,0:40:55.94,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}honey*honey
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:59.30,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}无论何时的你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.04,0:40:59.30,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}キミはいつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.37,0:41:02.52,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}lovely*lovely
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.81,0:41:06.32,菊地真-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}都是无敌的唯一
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.81,0:41:06.32,菊地真-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,85)\blur5}無敵のonly one
