Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.84,0:55:28.41,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}抬头仰望天  一起手牵手
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.77,0:55:31.29,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}この空は輝いてる
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.77,0:55:31.29,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}这片天空正熠熠生辉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.57,0:55:36.07,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}世界中の手をとり
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.57,0:55:36.07,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}紧握世界所有人的手
