Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.68,0:58:12.27,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}每人彼此  拥有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.59,0:58:15.14,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}ひとつに重ね合えれば
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.59,0:58:15.14,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}如果汇聚在一起的话
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.46,0:58:20.90,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}この地球の未来は　The beam of our hope
