Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.71,0:59:21.22,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}一个人办不到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.60,0:59:24.09,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}仲間となら出来ること
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.60,0:59:24.09,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}只要跟同伴一起就能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.40,0:59:30.02,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}乗り越えられるのは　Unity is strength
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.40,0:59:30.02,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}能跨过这困难的  是团结的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.18,0:59:32.73,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}空見あげ　手をつなごう
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.18,0:59:32.73,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}抬头仰望天  一起手牵手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.09,0:59:35.59,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}この空はつながってる
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.09,0:59:35.59,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}这片天空正连系着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.94,0:59:40.36,both-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}世界中の手をとり
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.94,0:59:40.36,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}紧握世界所有人的手
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.63,0:59:45.27,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}The world is all one {\fn思源黑体 Medium}‼　{\fn攸望轻吟体-Regular\b0}The world is all one {\fn思源黑体 Medium}‼
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.81,0:59:47.06,both-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur5}Unity mind.
